    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOVEY \u2661 DOVEY</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/b50cbc38e1c80ac20c47b811daaa0485.poster.avif?t=1701527869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/b50cbc38e1c80ac20c47b811daaa0485.webm?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/b50cbc38e1c80ac20c47b811daaa0485.mp4?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You've always been <i>super</i> into toilets. You use them so many times a day that you could be considered a #1 toilet fan. That's why you decide to visit an abandoned toilet factory.  Legend has it that there are <strong>golden toilets</strong> there - and <i>obviously</i>, you want them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/ed565c0f3317cea2da0c4a72a3640149.poster.avif?t=1701527869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/ed565c0f3317cea2da0c4a72a3640149.webm?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/ed565c0f3317cea2da0c4a72a3640149.mp4?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>However, <strong>Lovey Dovey</strong> (the toilet factory's mascot) is on the loose. Sadly, the only thing you brought is a rocket launcher. Hopefully it can come in handy somehow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/74ff9820207dc4ff46d7c9c84bf04352.poster.avif?t=1701527869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/74ff9820207dc4ff46d7c9c84bf04352.webm?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/74ff9820207dc4ff46d7c9c84bf04352.mp4?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect all the <strong>golden toilets</strong> and escape - but can you evade the infamous and hairy-legged <strong>Lovey Dovey</strong>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/0e202a9f173690a20c9c000e03c057c9.avif?t=1701527869\" width=800 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY \u2661 FEATURES</h2><br>\u2665 Average playtime of 20 minutes<br><br>\u2665 Collect the <strong>golden toilets</strong> of which the legends have spoken<br><br>\u2665 Use your nifty rocket launcher<br><br>\u2665 Escape <strong>Lovey Dovey</strong> &amp; the toilet factory<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/1d160be1573b064a37c0d007014eacd8.avif?t=1701527869\" width=800 height=150 /></span><br><br>Elevate your horror game experience and try Lovey Dovey today! This <span class=\"bb_strike\">very high-quality</span> <strong>comedy horror game</strong> will <span class=\"bb_strike\">not</span> flush your expectations down the drain!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOVEY \u2661 DOVEY</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/b50cbc38e1c80ac20c47b811daaa0485.poster.avif?t=1701527869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/b50cbc38e1c80ac20c47b811daaa0485.webm?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/b50cbc38e1c80ac20c47b811daaa0485.mp4?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You've always been <i>super</i> into toilets. You use them so many times a day that you could be considered a #1 toilet fan. That's why you decide to visit an abandoned toilet factory.  Legend has it that there are <strong>golden toilets</strong> there - and <i>obviously</i>, you want them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/ed565c0f3317cea2da0c4a72a3640149.poster.avif?t=1701527869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/ed565c0f3317cea2da0c4a72a3640149.webm?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/extras/ed565c0f3317cea2da0c4a72a3640149.mp4?t=1701527869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>However, <strong>Lovey Dovey</strong> (the toilet factory's mascot) is on the loose. Sadly, the only thing you brought is a rocket launcher. Hopefully it can come in handy somehow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611890/ext